      <h1>Building Neural Networks with <span class="accent">TensorFlow/Keras</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Master Keras, the high-level API for TensorFlow. Learn to build, compile, train, and evaluate neural networks using sequential and functional models. Implement dense layers, activation functions, regularization, and monitoring techniques for production-grade deep learning.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="objectives">
      <h4>Learning Objectives</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Understand TensorFlow and Keras architecture and relationship</li>
        <li>Build neural networks using Sequential and Functional APIs</li>
        <li>Design custom layer architectures for specific problems</li>
